TITLE Mix 50 mmol/kg DIC with 50 mmol/kg Ca in 1:1, heat 20 to 200C in 10 steps, allow calcite ppt/diss

SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 0.05
    units mol/kgw

SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05
    units mol/kgw

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 40 60 80 100 120 140 160 180 200

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
END
